yes?{01 00 00 05 00} That is good, friend,
for I have a gift for you!
{07 00 00}Some {ff 00 00 07}carpet {ff 00 00 00}or {ff 00 00 07}wallpaper{ff 00 00 00}?{01 00 00 0a 00}
